                                          780   # Extension SYS_Exec_88: Load code from ROM into memory and execute it
                                          781   #-----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                          782   #
                                          783   # This loads the vCPU code with consideration of the current vSP
                                          784   # Used during reset, but also for switching between applications or for
                                          785   # loading data from ROM from within an application (overlays).
                                          786   #
                                          787   # ROM stream format is [<addrH> <addrL> <n&255> n*<byte>]* 0
                                          788   # on top of lookup tables.
